{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267DBJlf1m581793233228.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市場預期12月的會議，甚至明年聯儲局仍會繼續加息，東亞銀行首席經濟師卓亮表示美國12月有機會加息。現時，美國核心通脹較聯邦基金利率低，美國仍處實際正利率狀態，料不會導致聯儲局進行一連串加息動作，基本預測12月有機會再加息，2027年利率大概保持不變。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:14.414606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T00:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.387271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:13.975999+00:00","content_hash":"81af29f1d27595e2871abd280b1c592db71f72c95816808164038194390b8149","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:14.414606+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}